cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: pyasteryx
abstract: >-
  A fast, dependency-free, specification-driven decoder for EUROCONTROL ASTERIX
  surveillance data, with first-class support for CAT062 system tracks. Reads
  raw bytes, binary files, pcap captures and live UDP/multicast feeds, and
  presents CAT062 records in engineering units with absolute UTC timestamps.
